  ],
  "notes": "Combines {受|じゅ} (receive) + {精|せい} (sperm, essence). The fusion of sperm and egg that starts a new life; applies to animals and plants alike. Used with する.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {体外|たいがい}{受精|じゅせい}: in-vitro fertilization\n- {受精|じゅせい}{卵|らん}: fertilized egg\n- {人工|じんこう}{受精|じゅせい}: artificial insemination\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {授粉|じゅふん}: pollination — the transfer of pollen that precedes fertilization in plants\n- {妊娠|にんしん}: pregnancy — the state that follows fertilization in mammals",
